{"id":"658677","name":"红烧牛肉","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/658677/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"1000毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉切大块。","img":"images/658677/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅里烧水开后放葱姜料酒。","img":"images/658677/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"及料酒下入牛肉焯水。","img":"images/658677/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛肉捞出用温水洗净备用。","img":"images/658677/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"料酒备用。","img":"images/658677/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"料包备用。","img":"images/658677/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"松茸卤料包一包备用。","img":"images/658677/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里放油热后放冰糖开小火化开变色。","img":"images/658677/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入牛肉翻炒。","img":"images/658677/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入开水适量。","img":"images/658677/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入一包卤料汁。","img":"images/658677/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入材料炒炒。","img":"images/658677/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入开水。","img":"images/658677/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"慢火炖一个半小时。","img":"images/658677/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"直到汤汁收干。","img":"images/658677/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"葱花切碎备用。","img":"images/658677/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放在牛肉上面。","img":"images/658677/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658677/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}